// ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓ INPUT enum types ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓ {

// --- enum MaEnable --- {
// @enum Used for input of "Enable HTF MA's" in settings for all TF's
export enum MaEnable
    individualy    = "Set individually"
    enableAll      = "Enable all"
    disableAll     = "Disable all"
//}

// --- enum MaDraw --- {
// @enum Used for input of MA's drawing settings for a particular TF.
export enum MaDraw
    individualy         = "Set individually"
    lines_and_labels    = "Draw all lines and labels"
    only_labels         = "Draw all labels only (no history)"
    only_lines          = "Draw all lines only (no labels)"

//}

// --- enum MaSmoothen --- {
// @enum Used for input of MA's drawing settings for a particular TF.
export enum MaSmoothen
    individually    = "Set individually"
    all             = "Smoothen all MAs of all TFs"
    none            = "Do not smoothen any MAs"

//}

// --- enum MaTypes --- {
// @enum Used to select MA type in inputs
export enum MaTypes
    SMA    = "SMA"
    EMA    = "EMA"
    WMA    = "WMA"
    VMAA   = "VMAA"
    SWMA   = "SWMA"
    HMA    = "HMA"
    RMA    = "RMA"
    TEMA   = "TEMA"
    VWAP   = "VWAP"

// @function Enumerator function, given a key returns `enum MaTypes` value 
export method getMaType(string this) => 
    switch this.toUppercase()
        "SMA"        => MaTypes.SMA
        "EMA"        => MaTypes.EMA
        "WMA"        => MaTypes.WMA
        "VMAA"       => MaTypes.VMAA
        "SWMA"       => MaTypes.SWMA
        "HMA"        => MaTypes.HMA
        "RMA"        => MaTypes.RMA
        "TEMA"       => MaTypes.TEMA
        "VWAP"       => MaTypes.VWAP
        => 
            runtime.error("HTFMAs.getMaType(): Unknown MA type: {0}. ")
            MaTypes.SMA


//}

// ▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲ END OF INPUT enum types  ▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲▲ }

// ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓ HTFMAs TYPE GROUP ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓ {
