// ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓
// ┃                          CONFIG IMPORT METHODS                               ┃ {


// ━━━━━━  _importPropAr() ━━━━━━ {
// @function Imports properties from objProps.arS into RsParamsMAs.RsMaCalcParams or HTFMAs.MaDrawing child fields  
// @param obj (one of objProps types) an objProps, ... opjProps8 object.
// @param prop (string) Name of the property to be set 
// @param tgtObj Target object to import prop values to. Must have method set(id, prop, val) for setting `id`'s property named `prop` to value `val`.
// @param maCount (int) Number of tgtObj's RsMaCalcParams childs of tgtObj to set (1 to 6, starting from 1)
_importPropAr(obj, prop, tgtObj, maCount) =>
    if not na(obj)
        objP = obj.mpObj.get(prop) // not checking existense of child mpS, mpObj, arS. Obj must  be initialised 
        if not na(objP) 
            _arS = objP.arS
            // log.info("\n --- arS ---\n{0>>", str.tostring(_arS))
            if not na(_arS)
                i = 0 
                while i < _arS.size() and i < maCount
                    _valS = _arS.get(i)
                    if not na(_valS) 
                        tgtObj.set(i+1, prop, _valS)
                    i+=1
            _arS
        else 
            na
 // END OF _importPropAr }
 
// ━━━━━━  importConfigRsPrms() ━━━━━━ {
// @function Imports HTF MAs settings from objProps (of any level) into `RsParamsMAs` child `RsMaCalcParams` objects  (into the first first `maCount` of them)
// @returns this
_importConfigRsPrms(rsPrms, oCfg, maCount) => 
    var arCfgKeysRsPrms = array.from("length", "type", "source", "enabled")
    if not na(oCfg)
        for key in arCfgKeysRsPrms
            _importPropAr(oCfg, key, rsPrms, maCount)
    rsPrms

// @function Imports HTF MAs settings from objProps (of any level) into `RsParamsMAs` child `RsMaCalcParams` objects  (into the first first `maCount` of them)
// @param this (RsParamsMAs) Target object to import prop values to.
